  ["key", "Authorizations are SAP's", "The authorization on the service endpoint, and the app's own checks in its code, as a transaction does them."],
  ["db", "Data changes are your code's", "An app posts through the same BAPIs, function modules or RAP actions as any program, so change documents and application logs apply unchanged."],
