  ["log", "Every request can be logged", "A monitor records user, app, event, timings and errors per request. It is off until an installation switches it on."],
  ["check", "Tested on every release", "Every change is tested on NetWeaver 7.02, Standard ABAP and ABAP Cloud, and in the browser on the oldest and the newest supported UI5. A system or UI5 upgrade does not break an app."],
